{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mech Builder 3D</strong> \u2014 your perfect escape into the Gunpla-inspired world of model building. Experience the relaxing process of building a model kit with complete freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly assemble, paint, and pose all your models. Build mechs, monsters, armors, and so much more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building all the kits will take around 7-9 hours of your time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 3D models and pieces have been carefully crafted for a relaxing experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >61 model kits to build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pressure-free experience: build your way, at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pose the models kits in any position you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock kitbash mode to make your own models with all the pieces.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1st Model","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667150/f7ec4effbe395b06d0a9368fd0f11e74bad00746.jpg"},{"name":"Kitbash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667150/ae237e049744dcaed5391cdd512e79e8d8e827c4.jpg"},{"name":"Decals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667150/4bf01256bb1353eb7bfd7b6ba6545182e501d888.jpg"},{"name":"Nippers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667150/7a3255b6f4e6f8dbc4d0daf432b1e70171965f78.jpg"},{"name":"Half way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667150/f09268781b7ef3471c8c7bbcde6221e62a74846c.jpg"},{"name":"Model Meister","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image